{"sha": "f662cef90aff728dff28fff9af17cc61fe72222c52593e8a324687032152aedd", "body": ["逆命题不成立：$u_n = \\frac{1}{n\\ln n}$ 满足 $n u_n =", "\\frac{1}{\\ln n} \\to 0$，但级数发散", "（见\\cref{exo:b1:series:6}，$\\alpha = 1$）。单调性不可去掉：", "设 $u_n = \\frac1n$，当 $n$ 为完全平方数时，$u_n =", "2^{-n}$，其余情形：级数收敛（平方项之和形如", "$\\sum \\frac{1}{k^2}$，其余项为几何级数），但在平方数处 $n u_n =", "1$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:series:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $a_{n+1} - a_n = \\frac{1}{n+1} - \\ln\\frac{n+1}{n}", "\\leq 0$，因为 $\\ln(1 + \\frac1n) \\geq \\frac{1/n}{1 + 1/n} =", "\\frac{1}{n+1}$；而 $b_{n+1} - b_n = \\frac{1}{n+1} -", "\\ln\\frac{n+2}{n+1} \\geq 0$，因为 $\\ln(1 + \\frac{1}{n+1}) \\leq", "\\frac{1}{n+1}$。二者的间距 $a_n - b_n = \\ln(1 + \\frac1n) \\to 0$：", "相邻（见\\cref{thm:b1:seq:adjacent}），共同极限 $\\lim", "a_n = \\gamma$（见\\cref{exo:b1:series:7}），且 $b_n \\leq \\gamma", "\\leq a_n$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $b_{10} = 2.928968 - \\ln 11 = 0.5311$，且 $a_{10} =", "2.928968 - \\ln 10 = 0.6264$，故 $\\gamma \\in", "\\intcc{0.5311}{0.6264}$。间距为 $\\ln 1.1 \\approx 0.095$，且", "按 $\\frac1n$ 的速度缩小：精确到小数点后四位（$\\text{间距} \\leq", "10^{-4}$）需 $n \\approx 10^4$ --- 区间是", "正确的，但很慢。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 裂项相消，$a_n - a_{m+1} = \\sum_{k=n}^{m} w_k$，并", "令 $m \\to \\infty$：$a_n - \\gamma = \\sum_{k\\geq n} w_k$", "（部分和的极限）。此外", "\\[", "w_k = \\int_k^{k+1} \\frac{\\dd t}{t} - \\frac{1}{k+1}", "= \\int_k^{k+1} \\Bigl(\\frac1t - \\frac{1}{k+1}\\Bigr)\\dd t", "= \\int_k^{k+1} \\frac{k + 1 - t}{t\\,(k+1)}\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "在 $\\intcc{k}{k+1}$ 上：$\\frac{1}{(k+1)^2} \\leq \\frac{1}{t(k+1)}", "\\leq \\frac{1}{k(k+1)}$，且 $\\int_k^{k+1}(k + 1 - t)\\dd t =", "\\frac12$，因此 $\\frac{1}{2(k+1)^2} \\leq w_k \\leq", "\\frac{1}{2k(k+1)}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 上界：$\\sum_{k \\geq n} \\frac{1}{2k(k+1)} =", "\\frac12\\sum_{k\\geq n}\\bigl(\\frac1k - \\frac{1}{k+1}\\bigr) =", "\\frac{1}{2n}$（裂项相消）。下界：$\\frac{1}{2(k+1)^2} \\geq", "\\frac{1}{2(k+1)(k+2)}$，其和裂项相消得", "$\\frac{1}{2(n+1)}$。结合第 3 问：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{2(n+1)} \\leq H_n - \\ln n - \\gamma \\leq \\frac{1}{2n} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{5.} 减去 $\\frac{1}{2n}$：$\\gamma_n - \\gamma \\in", "\\intcc{\\frac{1}{2(n+1)} - \\frac{1}{2n}}{0} =", "\\intcc{-\\frac{1}{2n(n+1)}}{0}$：修正后的估计", "精确到 $O\\bigl(\\frac{1}{n^2}\\bigr)$ 阶，且始终从下方逼近。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\gamma_{100} = 5.1873775 - \\ln 100 - 0.005 =", "0.5772073$，并有 $0 \\leq \\gamma - \\gamma_{100} \\leq", "\\frac{1}{20200} < 5\\cdot10^{-5}$，因此 $0.577207 \\leq \\gamma", "\\leq 0.577257$，即 $\\gamma = 0.5772 \\pm 5\\cdot10^{-5}$（真值", "为 $0.5772156\\dots$） --- 由一百项即得四位可靠小数，", "相比第 2 问所需的一万项。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 第一部分：", "\\[", "H_{2m} - H_m = \\Bigl(\\ln 2m + \\gamma + \\frac{1}{4m}\\Bigr)", "- \\Bigl(\\ln m + \\gamma + \\frac{1}{2m}\\Bigr) +", "O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{m^2}\\Bigr)", "= \\ln 2 - \\frac{1}{4m} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{m^2}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "第二部分：不超过 $2m$ 的偶数倒数之和为 $\\frac12 H_m$，故", "$\\sum_{j=1}^{m}\\frac{1}{2j-1} = H_{2m} - \\frac12 H_m = \\frac12", "\\ln m + \\ln 2 + \\frac\\gamma2 + o(1)$，且 $\\sum_{j=1}^m", "\\frac{1}{2j} = \\frac12\\ln m + \\frac\\gamma2 + o(1)$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 连续两次分出偶数项：", "$\\sum_{k=1}^{2m}\\frac{(-1)^{k-1}}{k} = H_{2m} - 2\\cdot\\frac12", "H_m = H_{2m} - H_m$。由第 7 问，此式等于 $\\ln 2 -", "\\frac{1}{4m} + O(m^{-2})$：故和为 $\\ln 2$", "（再次见\\cref{ex:b1:series:ln2}）\\emph{连同}其收敛速度。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 当 $N = 2m$ 时：$S - S_N = \\frac{1}{4m} + O(m^{-2}) =", "\\frac{1}{2N} + O(N^{-2})$。当 $N = 2m + 1$ 时：$S_{N} = S_{2m} +", "\\frac{1}{2m+1}$，于是", "\\[", "S - S_N = \\Bigl(\\frac{1}{4m} - \\frac{1}{2m+1}\\Bigr) +", "O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{m^2}\\Bigr)", "= -\\frac{1}{4m} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{m^2}\\Bigr)", "= -\\frac{1}{2N} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{N^2}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "两种情形下均有 $S - S_N \\sim \\frac{(-1)^N}{2N}$：恰为", "最坏界 $a_{N+1}$ 的一半，且符号已知并交替。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 取平均可消去振荡的主项：", "\\[", "S - \\tilde S_N = \\frac{(S - S_N) + (S - S_{N+1})}{2}", "= \\frac{(-1)^N}{2}\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{2N} - \\frac{1}{2(N+1)}\\Bigr)", "+ O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{N^2}\\Bigr) = O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{N^2}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "数值上：$S_{10} = 0.645635$，$S_{11} = 0.736544$，$\\tilde", "S_{10} = 0.691089$，与 $\\ln 2 = 0.693147$：误差由", "$4.8\\cdot10^{-2}$ 降至 $2.1\\cdot10^{-3}$ --- 仅一次加法，", "效果提高二十倍。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 交错误差每一步都变号，", "因此相邻部分和夹住极限，其平均", "消去一阶项；区间误差 $H_n - \\ln n -", "\\gamma \\approx \\frac{1}{2n}$ 符号恒定，故沿", "$n$ 的任何平均都无法消去它。对两个\\emph{区间}取平均确有帮助：", "$\\frac{a_n + b_n}{2} = H_n - \\ln\\sqrt{n(n+1)}$，且由于", "$\\ln\\sqrt{n(n+1)} = \\ln\\bigl(n + \\frac12\\bigr) + O(n^{-2})$,", "\\[", "H_n - \\ln\\Bigl(n + \\frac12\\Bigr)", "= \\Bigl(H_n - \\ln n - \\frac{1}{2n}\\Bigr) + \\frac{1}{8n^2} +", "O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^3}\\Bigr) = \\gamma + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{n^2}\\Bigr)", "\\]", "（第 5 问及 $\\ln(1 + \\frac{1}{2n}) = \\frac{1}{2n} -", "\\frac{1}{8n^2} + O(n^{-3})$）。取 $n = 10$ 检验：$H_{10} -", "\\ln 10.5 = 0.57759$，已在", "$4\\cdot10^{-4}$ 之内逼近 $\\gamma$。", ""]}